# ATL-India console local configuration.
#
# ATL_ADMIN_KEY deliberately has NO `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix. Next.js refuses to
# expose a non-prefixed variable to the browser bundle, which turns "the admin
# key must stay on the server" from a discipline into a build-time guarantee.
#
# It must match ADMIN_API_KEY in the repo-root .env.
ATL_ADMIN_KEY=
ATL_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
